  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyBody": "Sushi Tracker does not collect, transmit, or share personal data. It has no accounts, analytics, ads, or network services.\n\nYour counts, session history, and lifetime totals are stored on this device. If Android backup is turned on for your Google account, Android may include this data in that backup and restore it when you reinstall the app or set up a new device. That backup is handled by Google under your account; the developer never receives it.\n\nClearing the app data removes it from this device. You can export your own copy from Settings.\n\nThe app requests no special device permissions.\n\nFor questions, contact labradorsantoseduardo@gmail.com."
